Package: ranzer
Version: 1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 0
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libx11-6, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: RANZER Team <rivirusandamuthu@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/riviru/ranzer
Description: RANZER - Ransomware Detection Endpoint Protection System
 RANZER monitors directories for ransomware activity using multiple
 detection methods running in parallel:
  - Shannon entropy analysis to detect files being encrypted
  - Honey file deployment to catch any unauthorised access
  - Process behaviour tracking via kernel I/O monitoring
  - Real-time threat correlation with automatic scoring
  - Auto-terminate suspected ransomware processes (optional)
 .
 Includes a graphical interface and a full command-line tool.
 Ranzer files are protected with the immutable flag (chattr +i)
 so ransomware cannot modify or delete the tool itself.
